  "text": "Lexar® PLAY 2280 SE PCIe 4.0 SSD | Lexar Overview Features Specifications Part Numbers Related products Lexar ® PLAY 2280 SE PCIe 4.0 SSD Category: Uncategorized Capacity 4TB No longer available Key Features: Up to 7000 MB/s max read, 6000MB/s max write speeds¹ Designed to match and enhance your PS5 gaming experience Exceptional performance ensures reduced load times and seamless gameplay Tested and approved storage for your PS5 console lets you play directly from the drive – no need to transfer or delete games from your console Built with a stylish heatsink optimized for PS5 to maintain peak performance and power efficiency 4TB capacity lets you store about 100+ AAA games Features Specifications Part Numbers Related products See how creators use it IRL Loading TikTok... Features The Perfect SSD for your PS5 Designed to coordinate with your PS5, the Lexar PLAY 2280 SE PCIe 4.0 SSD is made to enhance your gaming experience. Game-winning Speed 7000MB/s max read and 6000MB/s max write speeds ensure reduced load times and deliver seamless gameplay. 1,2 Play Directly from the Drive Tested and approved storage for your PS5 console, this SSD allows you to play games right off the drive. There’s no need to transfer or delete games from your console – the 4TB drive can hold up to 100+ AAA games. 3 Stays Cool When the Battle Heats Up Includes a unique heatsink for effortless installation and enhanced cooling during intense gaming sessions. Rigorously Tested All Lexar products undergo extensive testing in the Lexar Quality Labs, facilities with thousands of different cameras and digital devices to ensure performance, quality, compatibility, and reliability. Specifications Capacity 4TB Form Factor M.2 2280 Interface PCIe Gen4x4 Performace Sequential read speed up to 7000MB/s, Sequential write speed up to 6000MB/s 1 Operating Temperature 0° to 70°C (32°F to 158°F) Storage Temperature -40° to 85°C (-40°F to 185°F) Shock 1500G, duration 0.5ms, Half Sine Wave Vibration 10~2000Hz, 1.5mm, 20G, 1 Oct/min, 30min/axis (X,Y,Z) TBW 3200TBW Dimensions (LxWxH) 80 x 24 x 10mm Weight 51.5g Warranty Five-year limited warranty 1 Up to 7000MB/s read, 6000MB/s write. Speeds based on internal testing. Actual performance may vary. 2 Due to PS5 limitations, maximum speed is capped at 6300MB/s when used with the PS5. 3 Based on 36GB average game size. Product appearance, performance, software, and packaging may vary based on shipping date and available inventory. Actual usable storage may be less than stated due to system formatting and other functions. 1GB = 1 billion bytes. Part Numbers North America Capacity Part Number 4TB LNMPL8S004T-RNNNU Sales Inquiry Form Thank you First Name Last Name Business Name Website Link Business Use Reseller System Integrator Other Email Phone Product Name Estimated Quantity Thank you for submitting your request. A member of the Lexar team will be in contact with you soon. Close Related Products Sort By: Default sorting Sort by latest Sort by name: A to Z Sort by name: Z to A Lexar ® Professional DIAMOND CFexpress™ 4.0 Type B Card Read more Compare Lexar ® Professional 1066x SDXC™ UHS-I Card SILVER Series Read more Compare Lexar ® NQ100 2.5” SATA III (6Gb/s) SSD Read more Compare Lexar ® Professional GOLD CFexpress™ 4.0 Type B Card Read more Compare Click outside to hide the comparison bar Compare Selection EN ES",
